**I am an independent Amazon SEO consultant for FBA and FBM sellers, brands launching on Amazon and agencies that need Amazon support. I optimise listings on Amazon UK and Amazon.com to help them appear in Amazon search and persuade more shoppers to buy. A listing audit is £495 fixed. Listing optimisation is £175 per ASIN. Ongoing optimisation is £750 per month. Start with a free 20-minute diagnosis.**

Amazon SEO (Amazon search optimisation) is the work of making a product listing rank higher in Amazon's own search results and sell more once it is seen. Sellers often build listings the way they would build a webpage. Amazon search works differently. Amazon SEO aims to grow organic sales. Whether PPC can then carry less depends on your category and margins.

- **Who it is for:** FBA and FBM sellers, brands launching on Amazon, and agencies that need Amazon SEO support.
